---
title: CI/CD pipeline
---
flowchart LR
    dev([Developer]) -->|git push| pr[Pull request]

    subgraph ci [Continuous integration]
        direction LR
        lint[Lint & format] --> unit[Unit tests]
        unit --> build[[Build image]]
        build --> scan{Vulnerabilities?}
    end

    subgraph cd [Delivery]
        staging[Deploy to staging] --> e2e[E2E tests]
        e2e --> approve{Manual approval}
        approve -->|approved| prod[(Production)]
    end

    pr --> lint
    scan -->|none| staging
    scan -.->|found| fix[Open security issue]
    approve -.->|rejected| fix
    fix -.-> dev
